Error: Jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker: Cannot edit through `p` — it is a read-only arm binding
  --> Tests/UI/arm_binding_write_blames_the_binding.jet:14:26
    |
 14 |         .Point(p) -> { p.x = 5 }
    |                          ^
 Why: An arm binds a read window into `item` when the subject it tests is written without `^`, so `p` can't change it, whatever access `item` has
 Fix: Write the subject with `^` so the arm binds a write window: `if subject.in_place() == { … }`
